# Missing Home Assistant specifications

Home Assistant already provides device controls, automation editors, schedules, history, account management and recovery flows. The gaps below concern **civica.uk design specifications and acceptance coverage** for those capabilities. They are not a claim that Home Assistant lacks the features.

The review found 30 areas that need a dedicated specification or a more complete task contract. Every item is a proposal. Completing this audit does not mean those specifications, adapters or tests have been implemented.

