## Review and implementation limits

The proposals were reviewed against the frozen [brand guidance](../styles/brand-colour.html) and [writing guide](../content/index.html). Their rules preserve native labels, user names, translations, permissions, data values and device capabilities. Illustration rules do not justify replacing functional icons, camera images or maps. A clinical or government source does not give this household application its authority or assurance.

This review used source and documentation evidence. It did not operate the user's Home Assistant, run physical commands, modify saved dashboards, build the site or perform new accessibility testing. The [whole-system audit](design-system-audit.html) keeps confirmed implementation findings separate from this proposed coverage register. Use the [audit checklist](../reference/component-audit-checklist.json) to repeat the review when the sources, rules or implementation change.
